===============================================================================
NOTE ON BUNDLED COMPONENTS
===============================================================================
This project bundles third-party components, each under its own license/terms:

- new-api        : AGPL-3.0   (QuantumNous/new-api)
- workbuddy2api  : MIT        (ardeyouxipianyi/workbuddy2api-hub)
- qoder-proxy    : MIT + usage restrictions (avaritiachaos/qoder-proxy)
                   upstream README forbids public deployment / multi-user / resale
- opencode-free-gate : see upstream README (GuJi08233/opencode-free-gate)

Bundling/distributing an image that embeds these components may have licensing
implications. For private/team self-hosted use this is generally fine; for
public distribution you are responsible for complying with each component's terms.
